        "Description": "47. \r\rYou have assigned to kill the remaining founders of the Ark Society.\r\rBeing the heads of major Energy corporations for at least half a century, they are single-handedly responsible for numerous conflicts over resources and the increasingly gloomy climate crisis set to unfold later this century\r\rOur clients, an equally shady cabal formed on Green industry, wants to head the Ark Society in their place and make life harder for heirs of old money.\r\rThey say you can keep whatever you can steal.",
